}
Q.news_headline = Q.foreign_authority_last_outcome;
!}

[? if foreign_authority_role = "ordinary_opposition": At the Sejm Foreign
Affairs Committee, Lewica publishes a compact dividing responsibility among
cabinet, President and Parliament. Neither Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister
+]** nor President **[+ president_name +]** signs it. Congressional staff still
receive one serious opposition doctrine, and both Polish offices must explain
where they disagree.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "confidence_opposition": The next support
meeting ends with a new condition in the minutes: cabinet must report its
American commitments and consult the Palace before asking for Lewica's votes.
That is leverage, not command. Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** still
owns the promises and the coalition anger created by accepting our condition.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "junior_no_mfa": Lewica reads the compact into
coalition council and refuses to let the discussion close without a recorded
answer. The portfolio owner keeps the diplomatic pen, but can no longer brief
Washington as though the Left's ministers had silently agreed. The coalition
leaves the room less harmonious and more honest.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "junior_mfa": Foreign Minister **[+
foreign_minister +]** negotiates a reporting line with the Palace and briefs
Washington inside the mandate granted by Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister
+]**. The channels become clearer. So does the risk that the Chancellery will
correct its junior partner if the ministry promises one step more.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "lead_no_mfa": Prime Minister **[+
prime_minister +]** adopts the compact as cabinet strategy and instructs the
coalition Foreign Minister to negotiate it. Washington receives a coherent
line, but the portfolio owner's party records its objection. Cabinet authority
has solved the briefing and opened another coalition argument.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "lead_mfa": Prime Minister **[+
prime_minister +]** and Foreign Minister **[+ foreign_minister +]** present one
mandate, then negotiate the cabinet's half of a reporting compact with
President **[+ president_name +]**. The American delegation finally hears one
account of Polish policy. From this morning onward, every success and every
failure of that account belongs to Lewica.?]
[? if foreign_authority_role = "caretaker": The caretaker records the existing
channels, schedules consultations and strikes every irreversible promise from
the draft. Washington gets continuity rather than theatre. The next cabinet
will inherit working telephones and no agreement secretly made in its name.?]

- @poland_event_queue: File the compact

@review_presidential
